{"id":"wb-8-504","name":"查拉路甫石窟","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"查拉鲁普","text":"查拉鲁普（藏语：བྲག་ལྷ་ཀླུ་ཕུག།，威利转写：brag lha klu phug），汉文又称“鲁普岩寺”（藏语：བྲག་ལྷ་ཀླུ་འགུག།），位于西藏自治区拉萨市城关区吉崩岗街道药王山东麓，是一座藏传佛教格鲁派寺院。1996年4月16日以“查拉鲁普石窟”的名称列入第三批西藏自治区文物保护单位。2019年10月7日以“查拉路甫石窟”的名称列入第八批全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%9F%A5%E6%8B%89%E9%B2%81%E6%99%AE","revisionId":93288941,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=93288941","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/f7e28eb56e7a1edbf9cf3e63.jpg","title":"Below_Chagpori_-_1993_lo-res.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Below_Chagpori_-_1993_lo-res.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/0/0d/Below_Chagpori_-_1993_lo-res.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"John Hill","license":"CC BY 3.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/3.0","caption":"Below Chagpori, Lhasa","width":320,"height":213}}